# CI coverage gate (blocks TestFlight)

Push to `main` runs **CI** (`bundle exec fastlane test`). The job fails if **line coverage** for target `KnowledgeBaseApp.app` is below **`MIN_COVERAGE`** (default **35%**, set in `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and `fastlane/Fastfile`).

**Deploy TestFlight** runs only after **green CI** on `main`. Failing tests or coverage below the threshold skips the TestFlight build.

## Before push to `main`

```bash
bundle exec fastlane test
```

Confirm the lane ends with `Line coverage (KnowledgeBaseApp.app): …% (minimum 35%)` and all tests pass.

## When adding features

- Add or extend unit tests in the same change as production code.
- If coverage drops near the gate, add focused tests (parsers, view models, services) — not UI snapshot churn.
- Do not lower `MIN_COVERAGE` without an explicit team decision.

